OL,3,GNEWSACounty seeks to forge global links
OL,4,Awith twin towns
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo town-twinning links have been
OL,7,Fapproved by a council and a third could
OL,8,Fsoon follow.
OL,10,FDurham County Council approved the
OL,11,Freinstatement of a relationship between
OL,12,FBishop Auckland and Ivry-sur-Seine, on
OL,13,Fthe outskirts of Paris, France, and a
OL,14,Fnew link between County Durham with
OL,15,FCastiglione dei Pepoli, in Emilia
OL,16,FRomagna, Italy.
OL,18,FThe local authority's Reform UK
OL,19,Fadministration said despite its stance
OL,20,Fon the European Union (EU), it wanted
OL,21,Fto build ties with communities on the
OL,22,Fcontinent.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
